 ## Background
-The 3-phase Marching Tetrahedra algorithm was proposed to address the inefficiencies of naive Marching Tetrahedra implementations on GPU. It was implemented in CUDA and compared with basic MT implementations [S1, unofficial]. The prefix sum operation in Phase 2 is typically implemented using the Cudpp library for efficiency [S1, unofficial].
